{"code":"087260","name":"모바일어플라이언스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2004년 설립, 2017년 코스닥 상장된 자동차 전장부품 전문기업으로, 현대폰터스㈜를 종속회사로 보유하고 있음. 영상기록장치, ADAS, HUD, 내비게이션 등 자동차 전자부품의 제조 및 판매를 하며, 레이다영상기록장치 등 융합 제품 개발에 주력하고 있음. BMW, Audi, Benz 등 글로벌 완성차 업체에 제품을 공급하고, 국내에서는 자회사 통해 B2C와 B2B 비즈니스 병행하며 브랜드 가치 제고에 힘쓰고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":247.0,"open":247.0,"high":247.0,"low":247.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":-88.266,"ret_250":-87.0341,"ma20":247.0,"ma60":247.0,"ma120":620.9333,"ma200":1171.71,"close_vs_ma200":-78.9197,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":null,"slope_120":-99.1262,"r2_120":0.6819,"slope_250":-93.5738,"r2_250":0.7105,"high52":2560.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":9.6484,"dd_52w":-90.3516,"mdd_1y":-90.4277,"atr14_pct":85.7143,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.0,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":29.1332,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":368970.0,"inst_net_120":3650.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":1.1334,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0112,"smart_net_120_pct":1.1447,"foreign_ratio":5.62,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.14,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-28.0,"op_margin_q":-32.1839,"op_qoq":3.4483,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-1033.3333,"rev_yoy":-21.6216,"op_trend_4q":-51.5942,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-18.65,"debt_ratio":39.02,"per":null,"pbr":0.19,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":5.62,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":